ndition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Legendary Resistance: Crowd Control</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>You have a +10 bonus to your next <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> affecting multiple targets.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Legendary_Resistance:_Crowd_Control\">Creatures with Legendary Resistance: Crowd Control</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Netherbrain\" title=\"The Netherbrain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png/30px-Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png/45px-Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png/60px-Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Netherbrain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png/30px-Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3